{
  "mode1_opening": {
    "runtime_key": "mode1_opening",
    "comics": [
      {
        "image": "res://assets/story_comics/master_delivery_20261004/image_2be0af89fdfcfb8c.png",
        "text": "门不见了。好消息是，迷路的似乎不止你一个。",
        "width": 1774,
        "height": 887
      },
      {
        "image": "res://assets/story_comics/master_delivery_20261004/furina_kettle_20261005.png",
        "text": "一位自称水神的少女提着烧水壶。\n出口还没找到，热水倒是有了。",
        "width": 1774,
        "height": 887
      }
    ],
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "n_muqzf5le_zgmfr",
        "type": "line",
        "speaker": "芙宁娜",
        "expression": "惊讶",
        "portrait": "res://assets/helltaker/dialogue_portraits/芙宁娜_惊讶_水滴瞳.png",
        "text": "嗯？旅行者？你也是找厕所时推错了门，然后发现门没了吗？",
        "next": "n_mutxol0a_6894t"
      },
      {
        "id": "n_mutxol0a_6894t",
        "type": "line",
        "speaker": "芙宁娜",
        "expression": "思考",
        "portrait": "res://assets/helltaker/dialogue_portraits/芙宁娜_思考_重绘_大腿根以上.png",
        "text": "我在附近只找到这把水壶。来都来了，先烧点水——总不能连热水都没有吧。",
        "next": "n_mutxph0w_obciu"
      },
      {
        "id": "n_mutxph0w_obciu",
        "type": "choice",
        "speaker": "芙宁娜",
        "expression": "思考",
        "portrait": "res://assets/helltaker/dialogue_portraits/芙宁娜_思考_重绘_大腿根以上.png",
        "text": "怎么样，来杯开水充充饥？水神亲自烧的。",
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "谢谢，芙宁娜可真爱干净",
            "next": "n_mutxv2cs_bf6ya"
          },
          {
            "text": "谢谢，我不饿",
            "next": "n_mutxyjmv_doe21"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "n_mutxv2cs_bf6ya",
        "type": "line",
        "speaker": "芙宁娜",
        "expression": "害羞",
        "portrait": "res://assets/helltaker/dialogue_portraits/芙宁娜_害羞_重绘_大腿根以上.png",
        "text": "我当然爱干净……等等，你夸的是我，还是这壶水？",
        "next": "n_mutxwqwn_39ol7"
      },
      {
        "id": "n_mutxwqwn_39ol7",
        "type": "line",
        "speaker": "芙宁娜",
        "expression": "害羞",
        "portrait": "res://assets/helltaker/dialogue_portraits/芙宁娜_害羞_重绘_大腿根以上.png",
        "text": "算了，先一起找出口。那颗水晶像个路标，别让怪物拆了——还有，看到厕所记得叫我。",
        "next": "n_mutxy7ry_j9nqn"
      },
      {
        "id": "n_mutxy7ry_j9nqn",
        "type": "ending",
        "status": "success",
        "unlock_character": "hero_03",
        "note": "芙宁娜加入队伍",
        "comics": []
      },
      {
        "id": "n_mutxyjmv_doe21",
        "type": "line",
        "speaker": "芙宁娜",
        "expression": "傲娇",
        "portrait": "res://assets/helltaker/dialogue_portraits/芙宁娜_傲娇_重绘_大腿根以上.png",
        "text": "竟敢拒绝水神亲手烧的水！这段不算，重来！",
        "next": "n_mutxzoo7_d17k5"
      },
      {
        "id": "n_mutxzoo7_d17k5",
        "type": "ending",
        "status": "badend",
        "unlock_character": "",
        "note": "转场动画后回到最开始的动画",
        "comics": []
      }
    ],
    "start": "n_muqzf5le_zgmfr"
  },
  "mode1_won": {
    "runtime_key": "mode1_won",
    "comics": [
      {
        "image": "res://assets/story_comics/master_delivery_20261004/image_c8a78d3bcaf9f0ff.png",
        "text": "黏糊糊的怪物终于倒下。\n你检查了披风，决定把清洗问题留给明天的自己。",
        "width": 1774,
        "height": 887
      },
      {
        "image": "res://assets/story_comics/master_delivery_20261004/image_206d504c522c70e7.png",
        "text": "刚才在场上帮忙的裁缝，已经先一步等在出口。\n她看了看你的黄头发，似乎认错了人。",
        "width": 1774,
        "height": 887
      }
    ],
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "n_mutx6u50_9jzk3",
        "type": "line",
        "speaker": "格温",
        "expression": "惊讶",
        "portrait": "res://assets/helltaker/dialogue_portraits/格温_惊讶_统一服装.png",
        "text": "嗯？黄毛。刚才忙着剪怪物，还没来得及问：你是哪条路的？",
        "next": "n_muty7h17_n5pa3"
      },
      {
        "id": "n_muty7h17_n5pa3",
        "type": "choice",
        "speaker": "格温",
        "expression": "惊讶",
        "portrait": "res://assets/helltaker/dialogue_portraits/格温_惊讶_统一服装.png",
        "text": "我正好缺个射手。你是伊泽瑞尔？伊？泽？瑞？尔？",
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "叽里咕噜说什么呢，跟我肘",
            "next": "n_mutya5su_z2m2m"
          },
          {
            "text": "是的我是探险家，也叫旅行者",
            "next": "n_mutyeq1w_dfdvv"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "n_mutya5su_z2m2m",
        "type": "line",
        "speaker": "格温",
        "expression": "害羞",
        "portrait": "res://assets/helltaker/dialogue_portraits/格温_害羞_原画风重绘.png",
        "text": "走就走。先说好，我刚才只是路过帮忙，现在才算入队。",
        "next": "n_mutye0z4_4nxvl"
      },
      {
        "id": "n_mutye0z4_4nxvl",
        "type": "ending",
        "status": "success",
        "unlock_character": "hero_13",
        "note": "格温加入队伍",
        "comics": []
      },
      {
        "id": "n_mutyeq1w_dfdvv",
        "type": "line",
        "speaker": "格温",
        "expression": "羞恼",
        "portrait": "res://assets/helltaker/dialogue_portraits/格温_羞恼_统一服装.png",
        "text": "好的，开拓者，我申请入队。名字以后再对，前面有个东西正拿炮瞄我们。",
        "next": "n_mutye0z4_4nxvl"
      }
    ],
    "start": "n_mutx6u50_9jzk3"
  },
